WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.399
The takeaway is simple.

00:00:01.479 --> 00:00:06.222
Classifier-free guidance is just the first-order
slice of a richer picture.

00:00:06.302 --> 00:00:10.723
Treat the guided score as a Taylor expansion in the
guidance strength,

00:00:10.803 --> 00:00:16.125
and a single extra second-order term buys you a
better fidelity-diversity trade-off.

00:00:16.205 --> 00:00:20.755
It needs no retraining, only a scaled condition and
a few lines of code,

00:00:20.835 --> 00:00:26.800
and it points toward exploiting the continuous
condition structure that plain CFG throws away.
